  "description": "High-performance DataGrid control for .NET MAUI (.NET 10+). Supports in-memory and async/server-side data sources, pagination, multi-column sorting, global search, per-column filters, inline row editing, multi-row selection, row grouping, CSV export & share, clipboard copy, conditional row styling, summary aggregates, URL and DateTime columns, progress bar columns, column drag-and-drop reorder, auto column sizing, and fully custom DataTemplates.",
